id: SAVE24-2
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: ops_record
target: crates/core/src/ops_record.rs
find:         self.ops.push(HistoryOp::Submit(text));
replace:         self.ops.push(HistoryOp::Submit(text.trim().to_string()));
expect-fail: submit_text_is_not_trimmed_or_classified
expect-fail: property_ops_follow_call_order
note: 送信の本文を trim して記録する（SAVE-24 の受け取った値のまま残す規則に反する）
